#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:1
msgid "TMA Pipelines, Tensor Cores, and ctm-rs Interop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:3
msgid ""
"The Blackwell kernels in this preview combine multi-stage TMA pipelines, "
"swizzled shared-memory views, and tensor-core MMA operations. Depending on "
"the workload, you can express the entire schedule in **cute-rs** "
"(`blockscale_gemm_cute`) or pair **cute-rs** with **ctm-rs** instruction "
"primitives in the same kernel (`fp16_gemm_256x352_cute`, "
"`sm100_fmha_prefill_cute`, `sm100_mla_decode_fp16_cute`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:7
msgid "1. Block-Scaled MXFP4 GEMM in cute-rs (SM120a)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:9
msgid ""
"In `blockscale_gemm_cute`, one producer warp (warp 8) fills a 3-stage TMA "
"ring buffer in shared memory while eight compute warps (warps `0..7`) load "
"swizzled FP4 fragments and `Float8E8M0FNU` scales into `Mxf4TiledMma`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:15
msgid ""
"Data flow of `blockscale_gemm_cute` on SM120a: 4 typed TMA descriptors feed "
"a 3-stage `PipelineTmaAsync`, consumed by 8 compute warps running "
"`Mxf4TiledMma` and an `Sm120Epilogue128x128` TMA store epilogue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:18
msgid ""
"// Shared-memory layouts and operand-role views (Mkl for A, Nkl for B)\n"
"type TileP    = Layout<(C<128>, C<32>), (C<32>, C<1>)>;\n"
"type SmemP    = ComposedLayout<Swizzle<2, 3, 3>, 0, TileP>;\n"
"type ByteSmem = ComposedLayout<Swizzle<2, 4, 3>, 0, RowMajor<128, 64>>;\n"
"type SharedA  = SharedTensor<Mxf4E2M1, f16, SmemP, Mkl>;\n"
"type SharedB  = SharedTensor<Mxf4E2M1, f16, SmemP, Nkl>;\n"
"\n"
"// Compute warps (0..7) wait on the TMA slot, load fragments + scales, and "
"accumulate:\n"
"pipeline.consumer_wait(&consumer);\n"
"let slot = consumer.index();\n"
"let s_a = unsafe { SharedA::from_raw_parts(smem_base.add(slot * "
"STAGE_BYTES).cast()) };\n"
"let s_b = unsafe { SharedB::from_raw_parts(smem_base.add(slot * STAGE_BYTES "
"+ B_OFF).cast()) };\n"
"\n"
"let scale_tile = unsafe { tiled_mma.load_scale_atom_128(&s_sfa, &s_sfb, wm, "
"wn) };\n"
"let mut kk = 0usize;\n"
"while kk < 2 {\n"
"    let scales  = unsafe { scale_tile.pairs_at_unchecked(kk) };\n"
"    let a_frags = unsafe { tiled_mma.load_a_128(&s_a, wm, kk) };\n"
"    let b_frags = unsafe { tiled_mma.get_b_tile_k64(&s_b, wn, kk) };\n"
"    accumulators.gemm(&tiled_mma, a_frags, b_frags, scales);\n"
"    kk += 1;\n"
"}\n"
"pipeline.consumer_release(&consumer);\n"
"consumer = consumer.advance();\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:47
msgid "2. Combining cute-rs and ctm-rs on SM100a (2-CTA GEMM)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:49
msgid ""
"On datacenter Blackwell (`sm_100a`), two CTAs cooperate on a `256×352` "
"output tile (`256×192` + `256×160` N-partitions sharing the A collector) and "
"accumulate into Tensor Memory (TMEM)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:51
msgid ""
"`fp16_gemm_256x352_cute` uses **cute-rs** for layout-checked cluster TMA, "
"pipelines, paired MMA, and TMEM epilogue slices (dialect-cute), while using "
"**ctm-rs** for cluster rank, barriers, and collective `TmemGuard` allocation "
"(dialect-nvvm):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:57
msgid ""
"In `fp16_gemm_256x352_cute`, cute-rs (teal) owns the 5-stage cluster TMA "
"pipeline, paired 2-CTA MMA, and TMEM epilogue, while ctm-rs (purple) "
"supplies cluster rank, barriers, and `TmemGuard` lifecycle in the same "
"Pliron module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/gemm-and-pipelines.md:60
msgid ""
"// Producer warp (warp 5): acquire the stage, let one elected lane post the\n"
"// expected bytes, then all 32 lanes issue the cluster TMA copies via cute-"
"rs\n"
"pipeline.producer_acquire(stage as u32, phase);\n"
"if rank == 0 && warp::is_elected_sync(u32::MAX) {\n"
"    pipeline.producer_expect_tx(stage as u32);\n"
"}\n"
"let barrier = pipeline.producer_get_barrier(stage as u32);\n"
"Sm100ClusterTmaCopy::copy(a, &mut a_tile, row, kt * 64, barrier, rank);\n"
"Sm100ClusterTmaCopy::copy(b0, &mut b0_tile, col, kt * 64, barrier, rank);\n"
"Sm100ClusterTmaCopy::copy(b1, &mut b1_tile, col + 192, kt * 64, barrier, "
"rank);\n"
"\n"
"// MMA warp (warp 4, CTA rank 0): paired 2-CTA MMA into TMEM\n"
"pipeline.consumer_wait(stage as u32, phase);\n"
"if warp::is_elected_sync(u32::MAX) {\n"
"    mma.gemm(tmem, &a_tile, &b0_tile, &b1_tile, accumulate);\n"
"    pipeline.consumer_release(stage as u32);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Epilogue warps (warps 0..3): allocate TMEM via ctm-rs, drain 11 slices "
"via cute-rs\n"
"if warp_id == 0 {\n"
"    TmemGuard::<TmemUninit, 512, "
"CtaGroup2>::from_raw_slot(tmem_token).alloc_collective();\n"
"    tcgen05::relinquish_alloc_permit_cg2();\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

